graph LR
    A[User opens Catalog] --> B{See sticky bar}
    B --> C[Row 1: Search + Sort + Filters + Grid]
    B --> D[Row 2: Set icon buttons]

    D --> E[Click set icon]
    E --> F[Cards filter to set]
    F --> G[URL updates with set_code]

    C --> H[Change SortSelect]
    H --> I[Cards re-sort]
    I --> J[URL updates sort_by + sort_dir]

    C --> K[Click Filters button]
    K --> L{Filter panel opens}
    L --> M[Rarity chips]
    L --> N[Color chips]
    L --> O[Price toggle]
    L --> P{Authenticated?}

    P -->|Yes| Q[Owned filter chips]
    Q --> R[Click Owned]
    R --> S[API fetches with_ownership=true]
    S --> T[Client filters to owned cards]

    Q --> U[Click Not Owned]
    U --> V[Shows missing cards]

    P -->|No| W[No owned filter shown]

    L --> X[Clear Filters]
    X --> Y[All filters reset]
    Y --> Z[Badge count = 0]

    M --> AA[Badge count updates]
    N --> AA
    O --> AA
    Q --> AA
    E --> AA
